repository-code: "https://github.com/mrinalbhaumik/Predominant-Mode-Inversion"

license: "GPL-3.0"

keywords:
  - Surface-wave inversion
  - Shear-wave velocity
  - Predominant Mode
  - VCPM
  - RCPM
  - Differential Evolution
  - MATLAB
  - Geotechnical Earthquake Engineering
  - Seismic Site Characterization

version: "1.0.0"

date-released: "2026-08-07"

abstract: >
  PM_Inv is a MATLAB package implementing the Predominant Mode (PM)
  inversion framework for one-dimensional surface-wave inversion using
  Differential Evolution. The software supports both Vertical Component
  Predominant Mode (VCPM) and Radial Component Predominant Mode (RCPM)
  inversion for estimating layered shear-wave velocity (Vs) profiles
  from measured surface-wave dispersion curves.
